{"build":"6c7a310@16/11/2026, 18:43:24","data":{"book":{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Livro de Kirtan","subtitle":"Seva Ashram, Campos do Jordão","slug":"pt","language":"pt-BR","sort_order":4,"songsCount":112},{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":71},{"title":"Pocket Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Nabadwip, 2013","slug":"en-pe","language":"en","sort_order":7,"songsCount":80},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":8,"hidden":true,"songsCount":166}],"nav":{"145":{"prev":{"path":"/lv/ohe-harinam-tava-mahima-apara/","title":"Šrī Nāmaštakam 7"},"next":{"path":"/lv/bhajahu-re-mana-shri-nanda-nandana/","title":"Bhajahu̐ Re Mana"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":145,"first_line":"ki-rūpe pāibo sevā mui durāchāra","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā"],"author":["Šrīla Narottams Dāsa Thākurs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ki-rūpe pāibo sevā mui durāchāra","śrī-guru-vaiṣṇave rati na hoilo āmāra"],"translation":["Manī nav nekādas patiesas pieķeršanās ne Vaišnaviem, ne manam garīgajam skolotājam. Ak, kā gan tādam nelietim kā man panākt sevī nesavtīgu kalpošanu?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["aśeṣa māyāte mana magana hoilo","vaiṣṇavete leśa-mātra rati nā janmilo"],"translation":["Mans prāts nepārstājoši slīkst ilūzijā. Manī nav ne kripatiņas vēlmes veltīt sevi Vaišnaviem."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["biṣoye bhuliya andha hoinu divā-niśi","gole phā̐sa dite phere māyā se piśāchī"],"translation":["Gremdējoties pastāvīgās domās par savu jutekļu objektiem, esmu kļuvis akls. Līdzīgi bendei ragana Majadēvī ir savilkusi cilpu ap manu kaklu."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["māyāre koriyā jaya chāḍāna na jāya","sādhu-kṛpā vinā āro nahiko upāya"],"translation":["Pat ja es spētu izārstēt savu aklumu un uzvarēt maju šīs bendes veidolā, es nevaru atbrīvoties no materiālās ilūzijas bez svēto Vaišnavu žēlastības."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["adoṣa daraśi-prabhu patita-uddhāra","ei-bāro narottame karaho nistāra"],"translation":["Ak, grēciniekus attīrošais valdniek, kritušo glābēj, tu neievēro citu grēkus. Lūdzu, glāb Narottamu Dāsu!"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/015-kirupepaibaseva-7","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ki-rupe-paibo-seva","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Ki-rūpe-pāibo-sevā-07-05"},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/ki-rupe-paibo-seva-mui-durachara/","description":"Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā. Šrīla Narottams Dāsa Thākurs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"ki-rupe-paibo-seva-mui-durachara"}}